  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong>About our brand and products:</strong> Tires Fast is a US-based online dealer for motorcycle tires, UTV wheel and tire packages, suspension, and exhaust. We carry over 25 leading brands, ship fast across the country, and specialize in complete sets and bolt-on packages that arrive ready to install.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong>What makes us different:</strong> Sharp pricing on complete tire sets and packages, real fitment support from people who know the machines, and order values most affiliate programs can't touch. Typical orders run $400 to $2,500.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong> 5% commission on the full order subtotal, not just the product you linked. A typical sale pays $20 to $125. Your personal code also gives your audience 5% off every order, so it actually gets used. 30-day link tracking, plus code attribution that works no matter how the customer found us.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong>How to promote us:</strong> Post what you already post. Installs, builds, honest reviews, and answers to fitment questions convert best. Put your code in captions and video descriptions, pin it in groups and forums, or link from buying guides. No scripts and no quotas. Coupon sites and bidding on our brand terms in search ads are not allowed.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Other information:</strong> Free to join, no follower minimum, and every application is reviewed by hand within 48 hours. Payouts monthly via PayPal or debit card. Top performers are invited to our sponsored tier, which includes product on us, paid content work, and a feature on our site.</p></div>",
